# Symlinks with these names (e.g. from a staging worktree) must never be
# tracked: a tracked symlink at a path where the real, ignored directory
# lives makes a checkout replace — and delete — that directory. Patterns
# without a trailing slash match links as well as directories.
experiments/vendor
experiments/*/results
.venv
